<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Calling Method</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.T1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">API Call</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">GPT-4.1-Nano <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite>, GPT-4o-Mini <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">8</a>]</cite>, GPT-4o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">8</a>]</cite>, Grok-2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>, Grok-4 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">9</a>]</cite>, Claude-3.5-Sonnet <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite>, Claude-4-Sonnet <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite>, Qwen-VL-Plus <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a>]</cite>, Gemini-2.0-Flash <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite>, Gemini-2.5-Pro <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite>, Gemini-2.5-Flash <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Local Call</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Phi-4-mini-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite>, Qwen2.5-VL-7b-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>, Qwen2.5-VL-72B-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>, Qwen2.5-VL-32B-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>, Internlm3-8B-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>]</cite>, Internlm2.5-20B-Chat <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>]</cite>, Gemma-3-27B-It <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite>, Llama-3.2-11B-Vision-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">29</a>]</cite></span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>MLLM interviewees and MLLM interviewers illustration. 11 advanced closed source MLLMs and 8 advanced open source MLLMs are utilized.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.2 </span>Settings</h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each model in Tab. 1 is designated as an interviewee, with 3 randomly selected via API as interviewers. The pre-interview administers 3 random Level 5 questions. Formal interview rounds each include 3 questions. Interviewers start with weight 1.0. Parameters are set, including <math id="S4.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.2</annotation></semantics></math> to ensure the rationality of weight adjustment, <math id="S4.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=0.5</annotation></semantics></math> to accurately measure model level, and <math id="S4.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=7</annotation></semantics></math> to cover full difficulties. The set number is 200.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Accuracy across different difficulties are calculated to verify interviewees’ capability distribution and set up a control group where we randomly select questions from benchmarks. The performance of MLLMs in full-coverage Q&amp;A testing serves as the ground truth. 3 widely adopted metrics is utilized for analysis, including Spearman’s Rank Correlation Coefficient (SRCC) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>]</cite>, Pearson’s Linear Correlation Coefficient (PLCC) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib31" title="" class="ltx_ref">31</a>]</cite>, and Kendall’s Rank Correlation Coefficient (KRCC) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>A comparison between the multi-to-one interview paradigm and the random strategy, where Avg.improvement means average absolute increase (percentage points) of our paradigm over random sampling in each metric.</figcaption>
<div id="S4.T2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:152.2pt;vertical-align:-74.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-35.1pt,15.5pt) scale(0.830782706268992,0.830782706268992) ;">
<table id="S4.T2.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T2.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;"><span id="S4.T2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Benchmark</span></th>
<td id="S4.T2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;" colspan="3"><span id="S4.T2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MMT-Bench</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;" colspan="3"><span id="S4.T2.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ScienceQA</span></td>
